# CQ3: Which areas make an AI system high-risk, and which Annex III point establishes each one?
PREFIX aiact: <https://w3id.org/aiact-poc#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos:  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>

SELECT ?area ?label ?article ?definition
WHERE {
  ?area a aiact:HighRiskArea ;
        rdfs:label ?label ;
        aiact:articleRef ?article ;
        skos:definition ?definition .
}
ORDER BY ?article
